  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Amazon rights in focus: People&apos;s and forest protection</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The poject aims to tackle forest crime in the Amazon forests of Colombia, and to improve rights and livelihoods of indigenous peoples and local communities (IPLCs) threatened in Colombia.</narrative>
  </description>
